---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base title="Phil Tarnowski · AI-Native B2B Product Manager" description="AI-native B2B product manager with 10+ years in SaaS. Led product and AI at Elate through Series A, then designed, built, and launched Endurance Grid with AI.">
<section id="top" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 32px 64px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 56px; align-items: center">
    <div style="flex: 999 1 580px; min-width: 0">
      <h1 style="margin: 0 0 28px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(40px, 4.4vw, 56px); line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: 0.005em; max-width: 14ch">AI-Native B2B Product Manager</h1>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 40px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.55; color: #C0C0C0; max-width: 58ch">I help teams find what to build next and turn it into growth. As a senior product builder with 10+ years in B2B SaaS, I led product and AI initiatives at <a href="https://www.goelate.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #4AB8D4; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px">Elate</a> through Series A. Most recently, I designed, built, and launched <a href="https://www.endurancegrid.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #4AB8D4; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px">Endurance Grid</a> with AI.</p>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px">
        <a href="#work" style="background: #4AB8D4; color: #0E0E10; font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px; padding: 18px 30px; border-radius: 12px">See My Work</a>
        <a href="#ai" style="border: 2px solid #8A8D96; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px; padding: 18px 30px; border-radius: 12px">How I Build With AI</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1 1 320px; min-width: 0; max-width: 380px; margin-inline: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 24px">
      <div style="width: 100%; max-width: 340px; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px; background: #4AB8D4; box-sizing: border-box">
        <div style="width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: 999px; overflow: hidden; border: 6px solid #0E0E10; box-sizing: border-box">
          <img src="/images/headshot.jpg" alt="Phil Tarnowski" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 0%; display: block; transform: scale(1.14) translate(1.5%, 5%)">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 12px">
          <p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1">Phil Tarnowski</p>
          <span style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px">
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/philtarnowski/" aria-label="Phil Tarnowski on LinkedIn" style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px; background: #4AB8D4; color: #0E0E10; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">in</a>
            <a href="https://github.com/philtarnowski" aria-label="Phil Tarnowski on GitHub" style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px; border: 2px solid #4AB8D4; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="#4AB8D4"><path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27.68 0 1.36.09 2 .27 1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.013 8.013 0 0016 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"/></svg></a>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="background: #1C1C1E">
    <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: stretch">
      <div style="flex: 1 1 220px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 28px 28px 28px 0">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.05; color: #FFFFFF">Where I've Built Products</p>
      </div>
      <div style="flex: 999 1 460px; min-width: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1px; background: #33363D; border-left: 1px solid #33363D; border-right: 1px solid #33363D">
        <div style="background: #1C1C1E; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; padding: 28px">
          <div style="height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center"><a href="https://www.goelate.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Elate website" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center"><img src="/images/logo-elate.png" alt="Elate" style="height: 30px; width: auto; display: block"></a></div>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; color: #A0A0A0">First Product Hire and Head of Product</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #1C1C1E; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; padding: 28px">
          <div style="height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center"><a href="https://www.endurancegrid.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Endurance Grid website" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center"><img src="/images/logo-endurance-grid.png" alt="Endurance Grid" style="height: 40px; width: auto; display: block"></a></div>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; color: #A0A0A0">Founder and Product Lead</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #1C1C1E; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; padding: 28px">
          <div style="height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center"><a href="https://innovatemap.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Innovatemap website" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-width: 0"><img src="/images/logo-innovatemap-mark.svg" alt="" style="height: 30px; width: auto; display: block; flex-shrink: 0"><img src="/images/logo-innovatemap-wordmark.svg" alt="Innovatemap" style="width: 90px; max-width: 100%; height: auto; min-width: 0; display: block"></div></a></div>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; color: #A0A0A0">Senior Product Manager</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #1C1C1E; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; padding: 28px">
          <div style="height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center"><a href="https://www.psiexams.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="PSI website" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center"><img src="/images/logo-psi-white.png" alt="PSI" style="height: 38px; width: auto; display: block"></a></div>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; color: #A0A0A0">Product Owner</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="work" style="background: #EDEAE3">
    <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px) 32px">
    <h2 style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.2vw, 40px); line-height: 1; color: #1C1C1E">Case Studies</h2>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 440px), 1fr)); gap: 20px">
      <a href="/elate/" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: #102A38; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden">
        <div style="padding: 36px 36px 28px">
          <img src="/images/logo-elate.png" alt="Elate" style="height: 28px; width: auto; display: block; margin-bottom: 24px">
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 14px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1">From $20K ARR to a Series A</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 28px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C8D6DD">Employee #5 and the first product hire. I led discovery, design, product strategy, the roadmap, and delivery. We shipped features that moved ARR, retention, engagement, and expansion.</p>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px 24px; margin-bottom: 28px">
            <div style="flex: 1 1 110px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1">&lt;10 → 100+</p><p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #A9C2CE">Customers</p></div>
            <div style="flex: 1 1 110px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1">200%+</p><p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #A9C2CE">ARR growth in back-to-back years</p></div>
            <div style="flex: 1 1 110px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1">4</p><p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #A9C2CE">AI modules shipped</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: auto; padding: 0 36px; height: 260px; overflow: hidden">
          <img src="/images/elate-reporting-assistant-crop.png" alt="Elate's AI Reporting Assistant drafting a status update with Strategy Advisor" width="1069" height="750" loading="lazy" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0">
        </div>
      <div style="background: #0B1E29; border-top: 1px solid #1C4A5F; padding: 22px 24px; display: flex; justify-content: center"><span style="display: inline-block; background: #4AB8D4; color: #0E0E10; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; padding: 14px 24px; border-radius: 12px">Read the Elate Story</span></div>
      </a>
      <a href="/endurance-grid/" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: #102A38; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden">
        <div style="padding: 36px 36px 28px">
          <img src="/images/logo-endurance-grid.png" alt="Endurance Grid" style="height: 36px; width: auto; display: block; margin-bottom: 20px">
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 14px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1">From Idea to $37K in Race Registrations</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 28px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C8D6DD">Founder and product lead. I researched, designed, built, and launched a website and two mobile apps (iOS and Android). Endurance Grid helps people pick a race, train with friends, and keep the memories.</p>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px 24px; margin-bottom: 28px">
            <div style="flex: 1 1 110px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1">1,000+</p><p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #A9C2CE">Race registrations driven</p></div>
            <div style="flex: 1 1 110px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1">2M+</p><p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #A9C2CE">Google search impressions</p></div>
            <div style="flex: 1 1 110px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1">850+</p><p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #A9C2CE">Workouts logged by training groups</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: auto; padding: 0 36px; height: 260px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; gap: 16px; justify-content: center">
          <img src="/images/eg-training-calendar.webp" alt="The Endurance Grid training calendar" style="width: 44%; max-width: 220px; height: auto; display: block; border: 8px solid #1C4A5F; border-bottom: 0; border-radius: 32px 32px 0 0; box-sizing: border-box; align-self: flex-start; margin-top: 24px">
          <img src="/images/eg-race-story.webp" alt="A Race Story in Endurance Grid" style="width: 44%; max-width: 220px; height: auto; display: block; border: 8px solid #1C4A5F; border-bottom: 0; border-radius: 32px 32px 0 0; box-sizing: border-box; align-self: flex-start">
        </div>
      <div style="background: #0B1E29; border-top: 1px solid #1C4A5F; padding: 22px 24px; display: flex; justify-content: center"><span style="display: inline-block; background: #4AB8D4; color: #0E0E10; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; padding: 14px 24px; border-radius: 12px">Read the Endurance Grid Story</span></div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  </section>

  <section id="experience" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px) 32px">
    <h2 style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.2vw, 40px); line-height: 1">Experience</h2>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column">
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 24px">
        <div style="flex: 0 0 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding-top: 30px">
          <span style="width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 999px; background: #4AB8D4; border: 3px solid #4AB8D4; box-sizing: border-box; flex: 0 0 auto"></span>
          <span style="flex: 1; width: 2px; background: #33363D; margin-top: 8px"></span>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; padding-bottom: 16px">
          <div style="background: #1C1C1E; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 28px">
            <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px 24px; margin-bottom: 14px">
              <div style="height: 40px; display: flex; align-items: center"><a href="https://www.endurancegrid.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Endurance Grid website" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center"><img src="/images/logo-endurance-grid.png" alt="Endurance Grid" style="height: 40px; width: auto; display: block"></a></div>
              <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: #A0A0A0">2026 – Present</p>
            </div>
            <h3 style="margin: 0 0 14px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.1">Founder and Product Lead</h3>
            
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C0C0C0; max-width: 72ch">Own product end to end for a consumer website and iOS and Android apps, built AI-native. Grew search to 2M+ impressions and drove 1,000+ race registrations with no paid acquisition.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 24px">
        <div style="flex: 0 0 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding-top: 30px">
          <span style="width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 999px; background: #4AB8D4; border: 3px solid #4AB8D4; box-sizing: border-box; flex: 0 0 auto"></span>
          <span style="flex: 1; width: 2px; background: #33363D; margin-top: 8px"></span>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; padding-bottom: 16px">
          <div style="background: #1C1C1E; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 28px">
            <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px 24px; margin-bottom: 14px">
              <div style="height: 40px; display: flex; align-items: center"><a href="https://www.goelate.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Elate website" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center"><img src="/images/logo-elate.png" alt="Elate" style="height: 28px; width: auto; display: block"></a></div>
              <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: #A0A0A0">2020 – 2026</p>
            </div>
            <h3 style="margin: 0 0 14px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.1">Product Lead and First Product Hire</h3>
            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px"><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 24px; background: #26282E; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 20px"><p style="margin: 0; flex: 0 0 120px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #4AB8D4">2024 – 2026</p><p style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 260px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600">Product &amp; Department Lead</p><p style="margin: 0 0 0 auto; flex: 0 1 auto; font-size: 14px; color: #A0A0A0; text-align: right">SVP of Product</p></div><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 24px; background: #26282E; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 20px"><p style="margin: 0; flex: 0 0 120px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #4AB8D4">2022 – 2024</p><p style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 260px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600">Product &amp; Team Lead</p><p style="margin: 0 0 0 auto; flex: 0 1 auto; font-size: 14px; color: #A0A0A0; text-align: right">VP of Product</p></div><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 24px; background: #26282E; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 20px"><p style="margin: 0; flex: 0 0 120px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #4AB8D4">2020 – 2022</p><p style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 260px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600">Founding Product Lead</p><p style="margin: 0 0 0 auto; flex: 0 1 auto; font-size: 14px; color: #A0A0A0; text-align: right">Director of Product · Employee #5</p></div></div>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C0C0C0; max-width: 72ch">Joined at $20K ARR as the first product hire and led product through the Series A, from fewer than 10 customers to 100+. Built the product function from scratch. We shipped reporting and collaboration features that lifted retention and engagement, and I led the AI product line, where we shipped four AI modules. Strategy Advisor drove two of the best upsell quarters in company history, and Plan Analyzer cut customer migration time 40%.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 24px">
        <div style="flex: 0 0 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding-top: 30px">
          <span style="width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 999px; background: #4AB8D4; border: 3px solid #4AB8D4; box-sizing: border-box; flex: 0 0 auto"></span>
          <span style="flex: 1; width: 2px; background: #33363D; margin-top: 8px"></span>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; padding-bottom: 16px">
          <div style="background: #1C1C1E; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 28px">
            <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px 24px; margin-bottom: 14px">
              <div style="height: 40px; display: flex; align-items: center"><a href="https://innovatemap.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Innovatemap website" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px"><img src="/images/logo-innovatemap-mark.svg" alt="" style="height: 30px; width: auto; display: block"><img src="/images/logo-innovatemap-wordmark.svg" alt="Innovatemap" style="height: 13px; width: auto; display: block"></div></a></div>
              <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: #A0A0A0">2017 – 2019</p>
            </div>
            <h3 style="margin: 0 0 14px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.1">Product Manager to Senior Product Manager</h3>
            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px"><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 24px; background: #26282E; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 20px"><p style="margin: 0; flex: 0 0 120px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #4AB8D4">2019</p><p style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 260px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600">Senior Product Manager</p></div><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 24px; background: #26282E; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 20px"><p style="margin: 0; flex: 0 0 120px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #4AB8D4">2017 – 2019</p><p style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 260px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600">Product Manager</p></div></div>
            
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C0C0C0; max-width: 72ch">Product strategy and product management for startups and Fortune 500 companies. Took a healthtech startup from concept to MVP, its first customer, and a seed round. Led a 20+ person team at a Fortune 500 through a UX overhaul.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 24px">
        <div style="flex: 0 0 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding-top: 30px">
          <span style="width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 999px; background: #4AB8D4; border: 3px solid #4AB8D4; box-sizing: border-box; flex: 0 0 auto"></span>
          
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; padding-bottom: 0px">
          <div style="background: #1C1C1E; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 28px">
            <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px 24px; margin-bottom: 14px">
              <div style="height: 40px; display: flex; align-items: center"><a href="https://www.psiexams.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="PSI website" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center"><img src="/images/logo-psi-white.png" alt="PSI" style="height: 34px; width: auto; display: block"></a></div>
              <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: #A0A0A0">2014 – 2017</p>
            </div>
            <h3 style="margin: 0 0 14px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.1">Marketing Specialist to Product Owner <span style="font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px; color: #A0A0A0; margin-left: 6px">PAN, acquired by PSI</span></h3>
